      "LYNN: Oh sorry, am I interrupting?\nELIZABETH: Um -- kinda.\nLYNN: Do you want to grab some lunch?\nELIZABETH: I'm in the middle of something, Lynn. My treat.",
      "ELIZABETH: What.\nSASHA: I'm a student leader for the D.C. trip --\nELIZABETH: Shocker.\nSASHA: And we're having our car wash this weekend. If you're around, maybe we could wash your car.",
      "ELIZABETH: Yeah, I love helping bums.\nMELODY: Oh, but you have to wait for dessert. We have a real treat.\nELIZABETH: If it's cheesecake, I'll stay.\nMELODY: It's even better than cheesecake!",
      "ELIZABETH: Um, yes! That sounds like a party. Lynn, do you want to come?\nLYNN: Yes.",
      "ELIZABETH: We're here to learn. Anyone else have a problem with that? Good. So who has the answer to my question? Everyone looks down.\nELIZABETH: Nobody's read this book? It's on the syllabus.\nSASHA: You never assigned it to us.\nELIZABETH: Well, now I am. And we're having a quiz tomorrow. Panic."
    ]
